{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"isCancelled","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":" { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"After the value of this property becomes "},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", it remains "},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" indefinitely."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"There is no way to uncancel a task.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This property returns the actual cancellation state of the task, regardless of whether","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a cancellation shield is active. Use ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Task\/isCancelled-swift.type.property","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" (the static property)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"if you need cancellation checking that respects active shields.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Instance property isCancelled ignores Task Cancellation Shields","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Instance-property-isCancelled-ignores-Task-Cancellation-Shields"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The instance property ","type":"text"},{"code":"task.isCancelled","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is not contextual and therefore does not respect cancellation shields. If a task","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"was cancelled and is executing"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with an acti